      <trans-unit id="about.body1" datatype="html">
        <source> Karaz Dev is a small web and mobile studio based in Qara, Syria. Our engineering habits come from somewhere else, though — time spent working inside Germany&apos;s tech industry, where code review, testing, and performance budgets aren&apos;t optional extras, they&apos;re just how software gets built. </source>
