          <context context-type="sourcefile">src/app/pages/about/about.html</context>
          <context context-type="linenumber">15,19</context>
        </context-group>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="about.body2" datatype="html">
        <source> We brought that back home. Every project we ship gets held to the same bar, with one addition the industry we learned from doesn&apos;t usually have to think about: most of the people using what we build are on a connection that drops, not a fibre line. So we design for that from the start, not as a fix afterward. </source>
